        "original_id": "8e08b489-830f-5290-a4f5-2f4162142cf3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reg Presley, Mike Newell, Charlotte Coleman\n- Works: Love Is All Around, Four Weddings and a Funeral, Love Actually, Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Worzel Gummidge, Marmalade Atkins\n- Topics: Film direction, acting roles, songwriting\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, Four Weddings and a Funeral was released as a British romantic comedy film directed by Mike Newell.\n- Charlotte Ninon Coleman was born on 3 April 1968 and died on 14 November 2001.\n- Charlotte Coleman was an English actress best known for playing Scarlett in Four Weddings and a Funeral, Jess in Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Sue in Worzel Gummidge, and Marmalade Atkins in her childhood roles.\n- Reg Presley wrote the song Love Is All Around.\n- Love Is All Around was featured in the films Four Weddings and a Funeral and Love Actually.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
